---
description: Never attribute AI as a git/GitHub contributor
alwaysApply: true
---

# No AI attribution

- Never add `Co-Authored-By`, `Generated by`, `Generated with`, or similar trailers for Claude, Cursor, Composer, Auto, or any AI.
- Never list AI tools as contributors in README, CONTRIBUTORS, LICENSE, commit messages, PR descriptions, or release notes.
- Commit author and committer must remain the human user only.
- Do not mention AI assistance in git metadata unless the user explicitly asks in that message.
